    <panel_attributes>title=SD14 Execute tools with bounded recovery
fontsize=14
obj=AgentController~c
obj=AgentPlanner~p
obj=ToolManager~t
obj=Six service-backed tools~s
obj=MemoryManager~m

c:At most eight steps in each accepted plan, clear request-specific results
c-&gt;t : resolveStep(step, successful results)
t.&gt;c : whole-value references resolved to actual data
c: reuse an identical successful action, retain exhausted action budgets
combinedFragment=loop~action c s; c:[Initial action and at most two extra retries]
c-&gt;t : execute(courseId, resolved step)
t-&gt;s : execute(courseId, arguments)
s.&gt;t : ToolResult with real status and data
t.&gt;c : result
--
c:Input errors require correction, insufficient data asks a question
combinedFragment=loop~replan c p; c:[At most two replans for this request]
c-&gt;p : replan(courseId, request, history, resultsSoFar)
p.&gt;c : corrected plan or clarification
c:Keep successful IDs and arguments fixed, aliases do not reset retry budgets
--
c-&gt;m : save request and actual response
c:Return earlier outputs and recorded failures if later work fails</panel_attributes>
